WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.070
It is ten past eight in the morning, and you open nori.

2
00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:15.150
Yesterday's sales are on one page, for every shop.

3
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.750
You can see which shops are behind, before anyone has to tell you.

4
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:25.850
You can see which numbers do not tie, and the gap is shown.

5
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:31.750
Discounts at the till, stock across the shops, all in one place.

6
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:37.230
Shops record their work on their phones, with photos as proof.

7
00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:43.010
Daily checks and cash counts are done the same way, and you see who is late.

8
00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:46.430
A request is waiting for you.

9
00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:47.850
You approve it.

10
00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:49.530
The decision is yours.

11
00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.990
Five minutes, one page.

12
00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.510
You know which shop is slipping before the week is out.

13
00:00:57.860 --> 00:00:59.830
Talk to us for thirty minutes.
